{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"40":"Prescribed Punishments (Kitab Al-Hudud)"},"section_detail":{"40":{"hadithnumber_first":4351,"hadithnumber_last":4493,"arabicnumber_first":4351,"arabicnumber_last":4493,"name_native":"كتاب الحدود"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4414,"arabicnumber":4414,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن محمد بن ثابت، حدثنا موسى، - يعني ابن مسعود - عن شبل، عن ابن ابي نجيح، عن مجاهد، قال السبيل الحد قال سفيان { فاذوهما } البكران { فامسكوهن في البيوت } الثيبات","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Maqtu"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":40,"hadith":64}}]}